{"id":"f0b39f920854da20","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ctl-fragment.md","title":"CTL 的存在路径规范语法","display":"df-ctl-fragment — CTL 的存在路径规范语法","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ctl-fragment","aliases":["29-df-ctl-fragment"],"display":"df-ctl-fragment — CTL 的存在路径规范语法","depends_on":["[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]"],"source_locator":"Section14.3.1, pp.236–238, scans251–253; Theorem14.29","source_basis":"用户 DjVu 文本层；扫描251、253原图核对；带标签规范语法及嵌入为本地显式重建"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ctl-fragment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ctl-fragment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ctl-fragment — CTL 的存在路径规范语法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" href=\"?note=e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-syntax\">29-df-ctl-star-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section14.3.1, pp.236–238, scans251–253; Theorem14.29"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户 DjVu 文本层；扫描251、253原图核对；带标签规范语法及嵌入为本地显式重建"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_k,\\mathsf P_k,\\iota,\\mathsf E,\\mathsf X,\\mathsf U\">\\(\\mathsf S_k,\\mathsf P_k,\\iota,\\mathsf E,\\mathsf X,\\mathsf U\\)</span> 及带下标的布尔构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" href=\"?note=e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-syntax\">29-df-ctl-star-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_c,\\bot_c,q_i\\ (i&lt;k)\">\\(\\top_c,\\bot_c,q_i\\ (i&lt;k)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{neg},\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{ex},\\mathsf{eu},\\mathsf{eb}\">\\(\\mathsf{neg},\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{ex},\\mathsf{eu},\\mathsf{eb}\\)</span> 是彼此不同的新有限树标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{neg},\\mathsf{ex}\">\\(\\mathsf{neg},\\mathsf{ex}\\)</span> 为一元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{eu},\\mathsf{eb}\">\\(\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{eu},\\mathsf{eb}\\)</span> 为二元。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\">\\(c,d\\)</span> 遍历下式生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k\">\\(\\mathcal C_k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf B:\\mathsf P_k^2\\to\\mathsf P_k\">\\(\\mathsf B:\\mathsf P_k^2\\to\\mathsf P_k\\)</span> 是下式给出的派生路径语法构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_k:\\mathcal C_k\\to\\mathsf S_k\">\\(\\varepsilon_k:\\mathcal C_k\\to\\mathsf S_k\\)</span> 按严格子树递归。下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 的大写时序记号均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k\">\\(\\mathcal C_k\\)</span> 上的语法缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf B(\\phi,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg_p\\mathsf U(\\neg_p\\phi,\\neg_p\\psi)\\qquad(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf P_k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf B(\\phi,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg_p\\mathsf U(\\neg_p\\phi,\\neg_p\\psi)\\qquad(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf P_k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{k,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\top_c,\\bot_c\\}\\cup\\{q_i\\mid 0\\leq i&lt;k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_{k,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\top_c,\\bot_c\\}\\cup\\{q_i\\mid 0\\leq i&lt;k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{k,j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal C_{k,j}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{neg}(c),\\mathsf{and}(c,d),\\mathsf{ex}(c),\\mathsf{eu}(c,d),\\mathsf{eb}(c,d)\\mid c,d\\in\\mathcal C_{k,j}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal C_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal C_{k,j}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_{k,j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal C_{k,j}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{neg}(c),\\mathsf{and}(c,d),\\mathsf{ex}(c),\\mathsf{eu}(c,d),\\mathsf{eb}(c,d)\\mid c,d\\in\\mathcal C_{k,j}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal C_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal C_{k,j}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_k(\\top_c)\\coloneqq\\top_s,\\quad\\varepsilon_k(\\bot_c)\\coloneqq\\bot_s,\\quad\\varepsilon_k(q_i)\\coloneqq p_i\\quad(i&lt;k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon_k(\\top_c)\\coloneqq\\top_s,\\quad\\varepsilon_k(\\bot_c)\\coloneqq\\bot_s,\\quad\\varepsilon_k(q_i)\\coloneqq p_i\\quad(i&lt;k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{neg}(c))\\coloneqq\\neg_s\\varepsilon_k(c),\\qquad\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{and}(c,d))\\coloneqq\\land_s(\\varepsilon_k(c),\\varepsilon_k(d)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{neg}(c))\\coloneqq\\neg_s\\varepsilon_k(c),\\qquad\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{and}(c,d))\\coloneqq\\land_s(\\varepsilon_k(c),\\varepsilon_k(d)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{ex}(c))\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf X(\\iota\\varepsilon_k(c)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{ex}(c))\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf X(\\iota\\varepsilon_k(c)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{eu}(c,d))\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf U(\\iota\\varepsilon_k(c),\\iota\\varepsilon_k(d)),\\qquad\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{eb}(c,d))\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf B(\\iota\\varepsilon_k(c),\\iota\\varepsilon_k(d)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{eu}(c,d))\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf U(\\iota\\varepsilon_k(c),\\iota\\varepsilon_k(d)),\\qquad\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{eb}(c,d))\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf B(\\iota\\varepsilon_k(c),\\iota\\varepsilon_k(d)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AX}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{ex}(\\mathsf{neg}(c))),\\quad\\mathsf{EF}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{eu}(\\top_c,c),\\quad\\mathsf{EG}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{eb}(\\bot_c,c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AX}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{ex}(\\mathsf{neg}(c))),\\quad\\mathsf{EF}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{eu}(\\top_c,c),\\quad\\mathsf{EG}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{eb}(\\bot_c,c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AF}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{EG}_c(\\mathsf{neg}(c))),\\qquad\\mathsf{AG}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{EF}_c(\\mathsf{neg}(c))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AF}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{EG}_c(\\mathsf{neg}(c))),\\qquad\\mathsf{AG}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{EF}_c(\\mathsf{neg}(c))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AU}_c(c,d)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{eb}(\\mathsf{neg}(c),\\mathsf{neg}(d))),\\qquad\\mathsf{AB}_c(c,d)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{eu}(\\mathsf{neg}(c),\\mathsf{neg}(d))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AU}_c(c,d)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{eb}(\\mathsf{neg}(c),\\mathsf{neg}(d))),\\qquad\\mathsf{AB}_c(c,d)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{eu}(\\mathsf{neg}(c),\\mathsf{neg}(d))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷237页、扫描252以“每个模态算子紧接路径量词”规定 CTL；印刷238页、扫描253的证明采用存在路径和布尔运算。本条给这个规范基底的独立代码树，并通过 ε 嵌入已有 CTL* 语法；没有把所有 CTL* 状态树都宣布为 CTL。</p>\n<p>原书 B 的定义已在印刷236页、扫描251图像核对。它是 U 的对偶：ψ 一旦在位置 i 失败，φ 必须已在某个 j&lt;i 出现；不是要求 φ 最终必定出现。EG 的规范代码使用 EB(⊥,c)，与原有 EG 的展开树可能不同，但路径真值相同。A、F、G 的规范代码由所列对偶式消去，因此涵盖原书 CTL 的常用派生算子。所有代码都是有限树；ε 每次只调用严格子树，故其存在性、单值性及目标类型由结构递归确定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathsf S_k,\\mathsf P_k,\\iota,\\mathsf E,\\mathsf X,\\mathsf U$ 及带下标的布尔构造子见 [[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_k,\\mathsf P_k,\\iota,\\mathsf E,\\mathsf X,\\mathsf U","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_c,\\bot_c,q_i\\ (i<k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{neg},\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{ex},\\mathsf{eu},\\mathsf{eb}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{neg},\\mathsf{ex}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{eu},\\mathsf{eb}","display":false},{"tex":"c,d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf B:\\mathsf P_k^2\\to\\mathsf P_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_k:\\mathcal C_k\\to\\mathsf S_k","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf B(\\phi,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg_p\\mathsf U(\\neg_p\\phi,\\neg_p\\psi)\\qquad(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf P_k).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_{k,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\top_c,\\bot_c\\}\\cup\\{q_i\\mid 0\\leq i<k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_{k,j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal C_{k,j}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{neg}(c),\\mathsf{and}(c,d),\\mathsf{ex}(c),\\mathsf{eu}(c,d),\\mathsf{eb}(c,d)\\mid c,d\\in\\mathcal C_{k,j}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal C_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal C_{k,j}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_k(\\top_c)\\coloneqq\\top_s,\\quad\\varepsilon_k(\\bot_c)\\coloneqq\\bot_s,\\quad\\varepsilon_k(q_i)\\coloneqq p_i\\quad(i<k).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{neg}(c))\\coloneqq\\neg_s\\varepsilon_k(c),\\qquad\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{and}(c,d))\\coloneqq\\land_s(\\varepsilon_k(c),\\varepsilon_k(d)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{ex}(c))\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf X(\\iota\\varepsilon_k(c)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{eu}(c,d))\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf U(\\iota\\varepsilon_k(c),\\iota\\varepsilon_k(d)),\\qquad\\varepsilon_k(\\mathsf{eb}(c,d))\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf B(\\iota\\varepsilon_k(c),\\iota\\varepsilon_k(d)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AX}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{ex}(\\mathsf{neg}(c))),\\quad\\mathsf{EF}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{eu}(\\top_c,c),\\quad\\mathsf{EG}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{eb}(\\bot_c,c).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AF}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{EG}_c(\\mathsf{neg}(c))),\\qquad\\mathsf{AG}_c(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{EF}_c(\\mathsf{neg}(c))).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AU}_c(c,d)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{eb}(\\mathsf{neg}(c),\\mathsf{neg}(d))),\\qquad\\mathsf{AB}_c(c,d)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{neg}(\\mathsf{eu}(\\mathsf{neg}(c),\\mathsf{neg}(d))).","display":true}],"bytes":3557,"backlinks":[{"id":"bd34a489475a6b08","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf S_k$ 是 CTL* 状态树集合，$\\mathcal C_k$ 是规范 CTL 代码集合，$\\varepsilon_k:\\mathcal C_k\\to\\mathsf S_k$ 见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]。$V_s^K$ 是 [[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]] 的状态真值。"},{"id":"f4d41d3758401af0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_k$ 及其构造子见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]；$c,d\\in\\mathcal C_k$。目标语法及 TC 绑定含义采用 [[29-df-fo-tc]]；TC 的体内 $x,y$ 被绑定，应用位置的端点变量不在该绑定范围。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-fragment]]、[[29-df-ctl-model-checking]] — CTL 规范代码、指点及全状态模型检查接口"},{"id":"d5d29e8c675bca09","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})$ 为非空有限 Kripke 结构；$\\mathsf S_k,V_s^K$ 采用 [[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]。$c\\in\\mathcal C_k$，$\\varepsilon_k$ 见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]。"},{"id":"cef4708b7fffcfcb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,b\\in\\mathsf S_k$；$\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)$；$\\mathsf B$ 是 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]] 的派生路径构造。$\\operatorname{TC}_S$ 为 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ctl-fragment]]"}],"outgoing":["e74e9bfdebb2e9eb"]}